<title>BRAZIL: Brazil aluminum output down 0.8 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Brazil aluminum output down 0.8 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian production of primary aluminum totaled 100,100 tonnes in January, Brazilian Aluminum Association (ABAL) said in a statement.</p>
<p>This was 0.8 percent lower than January 1996 output of 100,900 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
